{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"fp8-dynamic-vs-static-activation-scale","content_sha256":"sha256:fb8dce718b8034a06e58ed74e94075d8828c48131c97370f6046f304532c5980","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789955478.6032279,"domain":"llm-inference","explanation":"动态(current)缩放实时适配激活范围、稳健但有开销;静态(delayed/calibrated)缩放省运行时开销但依赖标定代表性,遇离群/漂移易溢出或损精度。权重多为静态 per-channel。","id":"q-infer-mag2-fp8-dynamic-vs-static-scale-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"动态缩放每步按当前激活最大值算 scale,精度更稳健、无需标定数据,但增加运行时开销;静态缩放用标定集预先定 scale,推理无额外计算、更快,但对分布漂移/离群更敏感"},{"id":"b","text":"静态缩放精度恒高于动态且更快,应始终使用"},{"id":"c","text":"动态缩放不需要任何缩放因子"},{"id":"d","text":"两者仅用于权重,与激活无关"}],"prompt":"FP8 推理中,激活的动态(per-step 在线计算)与静态(离线标定)缩放如何取舍?","review_state":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"tradeoff","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"FP8 formats","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2209.05433"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"vLLM FP8","url":"https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/quantization/"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"quantization","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
